An OpenRTB linter. Validates OpenRTB 2.x bid request and bid response
payloads against the versioned IAB Tech Lab OpenRTB specifications.

OpenRTB is a specification published by IAB Tech Lab
(https://iabtechlab.com, https://github.com/InteractiveAdvertisingBureau).
This product includes structured metadata (object names, field names, type
notations, section references, and enumerated value sets) derived from the
OpenRTB specifications. RTBlint is not affiliated with or endorsed by IAB
Tech Lab.

